      "status": "active",
      "owner_class": "ecl-registry",
      "introduced_in": "1.0-rc.6",
      "compatibility": "additive",
      "description": "Requires, before release, a human approval of exactly the decided request, recorded as an EBMP-2 human_intervention event that approves and carries ecl.ext.approval-record.v1 (EBMP2-016, EBMP2-017, EBMP2-063). The obligation's value names the approver and may name a minimum review time.",
      "attributes": {"category": "obligation_type"}
    },
    {
